<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in March 5 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in March 5 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 26</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............804,100 up.......900</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......701,300 up.......500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......532,100 down...5,700</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MARCH 5</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....817,115 up.....2,790</p>
<p> Financial companies.......633,372 up.....2,930</p>
<p> New York business loans....45,998 up.....1,009</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,745 up.....1,020</p>
</text>
